ume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-388ccccd-8aaf-48a1-b5c2-543708fbc81b"><syl /><neume facs="#m-0df0ebde-e819-4e79-b5ec-61b7c96360ae" type="punctum" xml:id="m-c460b540-8f65-4c1c-9777-360717c03c45"><nc xml:id="m-1ea0a59b-5b13-4c1a-8942-aa74a2d75ef4" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-6b617488-bde4-4b64-a78c-c241025fb41f"><syl /><neume facs="#m-5743553f-c225-4663-9b11-dbbfb06c7201" type="podatus" xml:id="m-eceb656f-5575-4865-8747-500d0e588e87"><nc xml:id="m-441110a7-1025-427c-b65b-112508d41fac" pname="d" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-af71524c-224f-4d92-b74d-e3fc2d70f85c" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-7731a65f-22ef-4f53-86a7-ca705e679be0"><syl /><neume facs="#m-e7e7f249-41e5-46ec-b98b-3fc09f7178d9" type="clivis" xml:id="m-2582a499-e226-47a9-9bc2-bd506d8a88c1"><nc xml:id="m-e93ed8f8-92cd-47e3-946f-95fe724071c5" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-56afcf85-a644-4557-9f57-914294de0209" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-91ed092a-429e-4cf7-b225-3163021e4b47"><syl /><neume facs="#m-97ce6df3-681b-4e31-a20c-cdb25dd898ea" type="scandicus" xml:id="m-f4ad50bf-3e41-41ba-9c69-8cc31d63d308"><nc xml:id="m-10381967-8936-4352-b5da-79b0710cb60d" pname="e" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-7ebaff89-d1f8-4c5f-bb7e-5a818653c5c9" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-73127132-3620-4516-8220-ee381ac6a494" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><clef xml:id="m-66c95814-5fd4-4982-b08c-652a6edd2f7d" facs="#m-d62966a1-eef1-4a28-b0e5-e61caf74541f" shape="C" line="4" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-8d03e84e-fad9-4e6d-a585-b7557ac8200b"><lg xml:id="m-a2fa12b3-e6ae-453a-9189-df68e0384934"><l xml:id="m-a8951983-7fb3-4340-8f8e-6bc3b1e1c58c" facs="#m-ad16c545-a83e-4bc2-8d36-7cc741137741" label="ambiguous">May 15. 16. 17. 18.</l><l xml:id="m-fcb6753a-334d-413e-a061-54c64570c909" facs="#m-3ae0e505-30f6-4ae4-8023-14de43aeb19e" label="ambiguous">1469</l><l xml:id="m-1363600d-6a36-437a-ad6a-5a2b894839d9" facs="#m-6136a8ff-6f32-48e3-84a5-b2efc4dc39f1" label="ambiguous">St. John Baptist de la Salle, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-4798d313-a43e-40c2-9514-1414ab914079" facs="#m-0245ae9e-9363-40c5-9350-28e1b5a09c6b" label="ambiguous">15.</l><l xml:id="m-6e68d6bc-9f29-4436-bf07-96763a360842" facs="#m-251d14ae-c757-4d47-8695-555f299acdbb" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-17dabb66-f49b-41be-9ab1-34559a4df9e3" facs="#m-ee4f7cc5-ce1e-4eed-b27e-ee97db3abebd" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. from the Common of a Confessor not a Bishop, p. 1200,</l><l xml:id="m-f66cc2e4-cfd0-4237-b08c-18b0f2959c8d" facs="#m-326af73c-a215-40cd-a0c0-7ad47f6630c5" label="text-like">except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-9796d45f-6b73-480c-8324-05593a5e600b" facs="#m-db83f096-dda1-48a0-ad2e-48cc8fb669cd" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-8383865b-60a9-4130-a9cb-a555a81e9b75" facs="#m-551263eb-d28d-4599-9fb5-b952f0929864" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ad christiánam páupe- concéde propitius; ut ejus interces¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c4edbbb-111f-4ffa-b9cf-99131ae1abc1" facs="#m-d3b985ce-afcb-4111-a4ef-dab3b1bc9670" label="lyrics-like">U rum eruditiónem et ad juvén¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3aed528-83fe-48ab-a01b-800de8116d8d" facs="#m-a146d48b-329b-47ac-a451-e0d1c2b44551" label="lyrics-like">sióne et exémplo, stúdio glóriae</l><l xml:id="m-67a998a7-4eaf-4cf3-bd1f-5c27fda255c5" facs="#m-aaff6eed-1959-49d0-8e53-0013a6199fd5" label="lyrics-like">tuae in animárum salúte fervéntes,</l><l xml:id="m-02f78474-7de9-47d4-8f22-c760862dd77e" facs="#m-6ea39b5f-8f52-4d84-b9f2-9947baf3f7e4" label="lyrics-like">tam in via veritátis firmándam, san¬</l><l xml:id="m-cc4dd558-34b5-4ed3-bd9f-01055e146408" facs="#m-c9b2339f-0a5d-49c0-b187-80f1d73c2b20" label="lyrics-like">ctum Joánnem Baptistam Confes¬</l><l xml:id="m-03a1f912-ea6b-46b1-a0f7-fe1f43076f48" facs="#m-4720fef7-c720-47d3-a2df-fa7429a4985c" label="lyrics-like">ejus in caelis corónae participes fleri</l><l xml:id="m-d5c14d9f-bfa0-4c5e-bfff-a2605dea1d57" facs="#m-d449bc55-5a6a-426b-b1ae-c9b48953a413" label="lyrics-like">valeámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-0020c5e8-2236-4df4-a375-b5f2a05cc58e" facs="#m-36a37e35-346b-4efb-ad5e-44477b6ef4b9" label="lyrics-like">sórem excitásti, et novam per eum</l><l xml:id="m-c62a9ce6-e6e8-4a47-bbba-659612ace9af" facs="#m-0a5665c0-63b8-41dd-8768-7d6599aa2c85" label="lyrics-like">in Ecclésia familiam collegisti: </l><l xml:id="m-b8386959-935a-43ab-9fc7-8475a7211708" facs="#m-f885dbe2-c584-49e5-9dec-3526d702a42e" label="ambiguous">4 Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 18.</l><l xml:id="m-9650d9ea-f419-43a0-9906-9019b4b7aa01" facs="#m-a70cf0f1-cf81-4f50-bf97-f3e4d6210285" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore : Accessérunt discí-[ non intrábitis in regnum caelórum.</l><l xml:id="m-ae59d5aa-6d6f-43eb-891e-287250224cb1" facs="#m-9649449f-7bfa-43ec-b109-a8e3c2e8b4ce" label="lyrics-like">Quicúmque ergo humiliáverit se</l><l xml:id="m-cfdd02a6-1f95-4532-afac-65860f7acd02" facs="#m-5e703651-1cff-4a12-96dd-a74beb46d304" label="lyrics-like">L puli ad Jesum, dicéntes: Quis,</l><l xml:id="m-d2cc1ef8-6343-4431-bf06-6dff9f972398" facs="#m-4c281661-81fb-469c-9787-182ede7932b8" label="lyrics-like">putas, majõr est in regno caeló¬</l><l xml:id="m-e14f78d6-666a-40e8-ac00-914314e6bf6d" facs="#m-21bef216-6a69-441a-a2f7-afe73dca8169" label="lyrics-like">sicut párvulus iste, hic est major in</l><l xml:id="m-e5feeded-b26d-4064-9e67-9d0ed88d75ea" facs="#m-91cdbac0-8145-4e50-98e0-ae05f8bde441" label="lyrics-like">regno caelórum. Et qui suscéperit</l><l xml:id="m-873de902-1b4a-4fa4-a965-e3f759cf9c44" facs="#m-5e6b4f6a-81d0-436e-90e6-e74558650b4e" label="lyrics-like">rum? Et ádvocans Jesus párvulum,</l><l xml:id="m-bebc55d5-c839-4d42-83f3-f2a70c17f73b" facs="#m-ca96fa8d-4347-4cdf-aa79-8327c8592bda" label="lyrics-like">státuit eum in médio eórum et di¬</l><l xml:id="m-a08e1efc-db5d-455e-b265-ae243d5f3e0e" facs="#m-fe7b3346-04ef-4a13-ab9e-6795be7f0d0d" label="lyrics-like">unum párvulum talem in nómine</l><l xml:id="m-10c52926-f055-428f-881d-e17dbd499821" facs="#m-af57b43a-d479-4f5c-9b9d-16dfa7579af9" label="lyrics-like">meo, me súscipit.</l><l xml:id="m-8b1c8f29-41a7-46b4-b5f7-abd8645af765" facs="#m-63335d8f-7248-457a-b1bf-581bc2847ed2" label="lyrics-like">xit : Amen dico vobis, nisi convérsi</l><l xml:id="m-48422896-9494-4a3c-b54f-5d733de68e50" facs="#m-bee58222-d83c-49af-a029-8420b9d74c8f" label="lyrics-like">fuéritis et efficiámini sicut párvuli,</l><l xml:id="m-1cfb6a38-5707-4c7c-971e-d9ceb8b16b71" facs="#m-df68bf32-e986-4a52-880a-b2a8e9cf21f5" label="text-like">St. Ubald, Bishop and Confessor. Semi-double.</l><l xml:id="m-f50da0a5-7534-4150-8104-1c232f3ee76e" facs="#m-751db59f-35ee-4645-a981-1c815584acb1" label="ambiguous">16.</l><l xml:id="m-85a8f8ff-dcd1-4c86-b281-77e8d0843119" facs="#m-9690ffaa-62ee-47cb-8d03-4fa4e6fe443d" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-1882c211-4d8c-495e-82e7-e63cbe6d5156" facs="#m-b72f35d3-2df8-4cda-a7ef-a3c8c1dd897f" label="lyrics-like">HUxslium tuum nobis, Dómine omnes diáboli nequítias déxteram</l><l xml:id="m-41fb69a7-ac98-4a90-ba01-810788342060" facs="#m-e566cc4a-d175-4b3d-8a7a-3ec68840fc12" label="lyrics-like">Al quaésumus, placátus impénde:t</l><l xml:id="m-e4f727e0-4f79-4749-a780-74aea5d4536e" facs="#m-d03d54dc-9f8e-4778-8146-911a14a5e507" label="lyrics-like">super nos tuae propitiatiónis extén¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d8798c2-d16d-4d46-aa0f-1d09f627eb16" facs="#m-47f440a3-11e3-45ed-b973-1eacdea4e53e" label="lyrics-like">et intercessióne beáti Ubáldi Con- de. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c1dae8e0-4162-4b33-96aa-9f6ebcbde4e2" facs="#m-1c017f2a-771a-43e3-afe5-b6ecf74fa946" label="lyrics-like">fessóris tui atque Pontíficis, * contra</l><l xml:id="m-86a25ed2-0790-4d50-b707-320e948c75c6" facs="#m-301f0ba8-0459-4995-bdd4-177adb5eff9c" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Sancti tui. and Postcommunion. Praesta quaésumus. p. 1185.</l><l xml:id="m-a39658ae-6c5b-4237-b063-280f98a90aa5" facs="#m-ee90c9c0-3a1e-40bf-b983-58f58d598887" label="ambiguous">17.</l><l xml:id="m-17d4f052-05b2-4d5b-b6dc-f6772d992c42" facs="#m-8e9890e9-8302-4fc1-8c8a-7b82678093ec" label="ambiguous">St. Paschal Baylon, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-3589adcd-ab81-4019-b1d8-8a50dffb0b92" facs="#m-70e08616-2038-4d23-903f-a933514ed863" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-ef6f6b29-7fdc-429e-bdb6-6af7dee2c445" facs="#m-3cccecdd-6ee5-4422-890d-63de6f7ae8cc" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. from the Common of a Confessor not a Bishop, p. 1200.</l><l xml:id="m-a90dcfe7-3906-4bc1-934c-7066c9ea532a" facs="#m-09ad6bfe-2c5e-485c-a599-9ffc350aaaa4" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-b991a891-40ae-4256-b592-937d86eb9fd9" facs="#m-7be4803a-1408-42ce-b095-cea0093d513b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Paschâlem Con- divíno convivio spíritus percépit</l><l xml:id="m-a2b76c87-4d14-4a7a-a250-d5f6d555903c" facs="#m-fb6d0385-ea99-40d3-89df-e64e69eea8a9" label="lyrics-like">pinguédinem, * eámdem et nos per¬</l><l xml:id="m-18b61147-3e3e-49de-a8ec-8dbb8d69937d" facs="#m-3b301c14-d2c4-42a9-a670-08737a12ecbe" label="lyrics-like">U fessórem tuum mirífica erga</l><l xml:id="m-9f18d77c-aa48-46e7-934d-03154d9f3376" facs="#m-e2090b3b-e4a2-4545-815f-b71be314eff3" label="lyrics-like">cipere mereámur. Qui vivis et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d9e1518-27cc-4d67-8129-2dcb60976b4f" facs="#m-fdc31305-792a-4ff2-abfe-ab8fb8ac49ba" label="lyrics-like">Córporis et Sánguinis tui sacra my¬</l><l xml:id="m-79ec7875-cdff-4df6-9bee-d83fa18c63de" facs="#m-8d362ce3-e3eb-4c51-99c3-d306d31ef614" label="lyrics-like">stéria dilectióne decorásti : t concé¬</l><l xml:id="m-cee0f78f-b70d-4467-bb76-09ab8ee02085" facs="#m-1ac01f6a-a73e-48ca-90e0-f67bbb5cf0f8" label="ambiguous">gnas cum Deo Patre.</l><l xml:id="m-dd1ae5dc-768d-45c0-8dfb-f56eb4c32269" facs="#m-21a2f449-7e91-4294-bde3-b7fef10675ed" label="ambiguous">de propitius; ut, quam ille ex hoc</l><l xml:id="m-67b29231-22a9-438c-8420-ad508000b0ce" facs="#m-fe2cc0ca-3d39-4394-a05a-65d8ec4c4926" label="ambiguous">18.</l><l xml:id="m-d5cd69ae-0151-4423-aa70-356ab69b19d9" facs="#m-ce1c3d89-2210-4ae2-9cac-279a7cfba7e2" label="ambiguous">St. Venantius, Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-635eb81d-d112-4a89-8eca-79c09823647f" facs="#m-6bc3247d-24c4-4304-b840-52a7e8d034b6" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-8d8085dd-c56a-429c-9efc-85e73ac38886" facs="#m-f3c11a84-b50b-4070-a022-8fe05b389588" label="text-like">At First Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-57e3dfa5-22b8-4653-b770-2652d5e43edf" facs="#m-58b54a77-837d-47f9-8d45-fd025662c8d7" label="ambiguous">Hymn.!</l><l xml:id="m-2074f61b-c636-43d1-96d7-bd12d341e52e" facs="#m-c92eb449-ab2c-43a0-905c-2724b4856ed5" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-38973bda-0426-4b23-98ae-d67d8be6507f" facs="#m-4dd69570-2d45-48a0-ac86-f57cb8b1f281" label="ambiguous">m</l><l xml:id="m-71d74989-066e-4f2c-b114-e013f4ae6c26" facs="#m-c1317364-06ad-4310-a8d0-53b70480dce5" label="lyrics-like">Artyr Dé-i Venánti-us, Lux et décus Camér¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>